---
/**
 * Methods ("How I work") section component.
 * Displays 4 numbered method cards on a dark teal background.
 */
---

<section class="methods" id="methods">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="methods-head">
      <div>
        <span class="section-kicker">How I work</span>
        <h2 class="dark-title">Rigorous, direct and designed for use.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>I am most comfortable with unstructured problems. I establish the decision that has to be made, identify the minimum evidence needed, and keep a strategic view while working through the detail. Clients value an honest assessment, including when the promised model or conclusion is not yet defensible.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="method-grid">
      <article class="method">
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <h3>Start with the decision</h3>
        <p>Define what must be decided, by whom and by when before building a model or collecting more data.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="method">
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <h3>Follow the whole pathway</h3>
        <p>Look across organisations, incentives, patient flow, workforce, data and funding rather than optimising one isolated component.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="method">
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <h3>Challenge constructively</h3>
        <p>Test assumptions, distinguish evidence from aspiration and provide a practical alternative rather than simply identifying a flaw.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="method">
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <h3>Leave something usable</h3>
        <p>Build tools, decision frameworks and operating approaches that can be embedded, tested and improved — not just a presentation.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
